[{"id":2692638518,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6gfmc2","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"fa725506fdd1163f259446427bcb562b65d60fdd","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected in Forward+ and Mobile.\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- Meshes are not listed when using Compatibility. This makes the total memory usage look lower than it really is compared to other rendering methods.\r\n  - This should either be implemented, or a message should be added somewhere when using Compatibility to tell the user that meshes aren't tracked in the video RAM profiler.\r\n- Since meshes now have an icon displayed next to them, textures should also have a texture icon to ensure alignment. I'd probably use `Texture2D` for this, but perhaps `Cubemap` and `CubemapArray` can be used when relevant.\r\n- There are a lot of unnamed entries with few vertices – sometimes even 0 vertices, amounting to 0 bytes. Should we hide entries that amount to 0 bytes from the list?\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f495d5bf-2f0a-49d9-883b-375dc47b54b8)\r\n\r\nThis also occasionally happens with textures, at least in Compatibility:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f487423-9784-4e0f-91eb-927b78efcdd2)\r\n\r\nAlso note the bottommost entry that matches the viewport resolution and is listed at 0 bytes. Is this a reference to the swapchain being held? I'd expect it to take about 3 MB of VRAM (`1152*648*4`).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103238#pullrequestreview-2692638518","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103238","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-18T02:21:09Z"},{"id":2700560126,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6g90b-","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"08813da9097c49aa5a66fc5d5dcdf6800bd76150","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103238#pullrequestreview-2700560126","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103238","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-19T23:38:06Z"},{"id":2700560361,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6g90fp","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"08813da9097c49aa5a66fc5d5dcdf6800bd76150","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103238#pullrequestreview-2700560361","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103238","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-19T23:38:13Z"},{"id":2700560543,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6g90if","state":"COMMENTED","commit_i